{"_ts": 1791850834.5245893, "concerns": [{"id": "ordering-01c3c477", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T001", "text": "Task **T001** is tagged `[P]` (parallel\u2011safe) but it creates the canonical project layout and core configuration files, which must be completed before any other task can run. This introduces an implicit ordering requirement, violating the `[P]` contract.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-f96af076", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T002", "text": "Task **T002** is also marked `[P]` yet it depends on the layout created by T001 and must finish before any preprocessing (T003/T004) can start. The `[P]` tag is therefore inaccurate.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-6c83d7be", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T003", "text": "Task **T003** (fMRIPrep run) is marked `[P]` but it requires the datasets downloaded in T002 and cannot be executed in parallel with tasks that depend on its outputs (e.g., T005).", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-96126270", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T004", "text": "Task **T004** (Nilearn fallback) is `[P]` yet it is a contingency for T003 and must be orchestrated after T003\u2019s status is known.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-5cf77123", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T005", "text": "Task **T005** is `[P]` but it consumes the preprocessing outputs from T003/T004; it cannot run before those tasks complete.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-af01d759", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T006", "text": "Task **T006** is `[P]` yet it depends on the ROI time\u2011series produced by T005.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-9eeacce7", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T007", "text": "Task **T007** is `[P]` but requires the connectivity matrices generated by T006.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-caaf7dba", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T008", "text": "Task **T008** is `[P]` yet it needs the paired\u2011test results from T007 before it can apply NBS correction.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-83bccd85", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T009", "text": "Task **T009** is `[P]` but it analyses motion\u2011threshold effects on the connectivity matrices produced by T006 (and implicitly on effect\u2011size estimates from T007).", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-f7ac130e", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T010", "text": "Task **T010** is `[P]` yet it uses the observed pooled effect size derived from T007/T008.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-e36735f4", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T011", "text": "Task **T011** is `[P]` but it depends on the effect\u2011size table produced by T008 and on the dataset count verified in T002; it cannot be parallel\u2011safe with those producers.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-65a673da", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T012", "text": "Task **T012** is `[P]` yet it aggregates results from all prior tasks; it must run after them.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-a3be745e", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T013", "text": "Task **T013** is `[P]` but it validates the *entire* pipeline; it must be executed after every preceding task.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-596a1484", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T014", "text": "Task **T014** is `[P]` yet it scans result files that are only produced after T013; it cannot be parallel\u2011safe with earlier tasks.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-44ae1108", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T015", "text": "Task **T015** is `[P]` but it generates a reproducibility checklist that depends on artifacts created throughout the pipeline; it must run after those artifacts exist.", "round": 1}, {"id": "ordering-9de91d4a", "reviewer": "ordering", "severity": "requirement", "artifact": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md", "location": "projects/PROJ-103-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/specs/001-assessing-the-impact-of-mindfulness-trai/tasks.md:T002", "text": "Task **T002** references a design\u2011verification script `verify_design.py` (see T012b) that is not defined anywhere in the task list, leaving a missing producer for the design\u2011verification step required by FR\u2011008 and FR\u2011011.", "round": 1}]}